"The official English phrasing is 'System, loop me in at [place] for sixty minutes.'"
"The System recommends a volunteer to staff for tasks, who must confirm each one."
"Distance volunteering permission lets the System teleport a volunteer to the task."
"The interface marks with arrows where a volunteer may go, and revokes access without business."
"A volunteer coordinator receives updates on everything a System volunteer does."
"Anesidoran hospital volunteers wear navy polos and badges with short informative nicknames."
